{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20267xfqWA5CxT1792803382.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>[09:13更新]</p><p>港鐵：於何文田站附近的信號設備事故已處理，觀塘綫列車服務陸續恢復正常。</p><p></p><p>[09:02]</p><p>港鐵表示，由於何文田站附近有信號設備故障，列車行經該路段需要慢駛，觀塘綫整體行車時間預計需要額外10至15分鐘。港鐵人員正在處理，呼籲乘客為行程預留充裕時間。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T02:35:16.632124+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T01:13:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T00:16:22.327998+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T02:28:32.760003+00:00","content_hash":"235e017fe69c2d1809acd4b20536670c8580629a78f38df598bf33ba42f8ab51","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T02:35:16.632124+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}